    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a subject that I appreciate for its precision and logical structure. While it wasn't my strongest academic focus during school, I find joy in solving problems that require analytical thinking. It's a language that feels both challenging and rewarding when I can grasp its patterns. My interest is more about applying math to real-world scenarios than abstract theory.",
